    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 ways to not die - this is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >well, in short: two Russian homies are sitting in their hut and start hearing strange sounds from the roof, naturally they go to check what's going on there. And then... you have the opportunity to decide what happens next, but to be honest, I don't care. Just enjoy and don't expect anything serious from this short adventure. We're just funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamism and nonlinearity: there are like 17 forks, but that's not certain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual narration: I won't say how many endings there actually are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real cinema: you'll see a movie with live actors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ATTENTION! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your attention!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 ways to not die - this is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >well, in short: two Russian homies are sitting in their hut and start hearing strange sounds from the roof, naturally they go to check what's going on there. And then... you have the opportunity to decide what happens next, but to be honest, I don't care. Just enjoy and don't expect anything serious from this short adventure. We're just funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamism and nonlinearity: there are like 17 forks, but that's not certain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual narration: I won't say how many endings there actually are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real cinema: you'll see a movie with live actors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ATTENTION! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your attention!</p>",
